  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread beef onto skewers, alternating with onion and garlic.",
    "3. Brush skewers with vegetable oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "4. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until charred.",
    "5. Meanwhile, mix together tomato paste, ketchup, soy sauce, honey, and paprika in a small bowl.",
    "6. Brush sauce onto skewers during last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Serve hot with additional sauce on the side."
